WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.690
John's Gospel opens with
the Word, who was with God,

2
00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:05.420
and was God.

3
00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:09.700
Then it says that the Word
became flesh, and lived among us.

4
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.770
Catholic churches are full
of crucifixes and statues.

5
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.710
If God became human, can
Christians make pictures of him?

6
00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:20.630
And does God know what suffering is?

7
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:25.530
In this mission, you'll see how Catholics
speak of Jesus as fully God and fully

8
00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.610
human.

9
00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:31.040
Then you'll weigh up a big claim
about what the Incarnation changes.

10
00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:35.490
Your mission: find out what the
Incarnation means for pictures of Jesus,

11
00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.070
and for human suffering.
